                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ce244884-bc9a-38e4-bf83-98a10c6209c3",
                        "entry_id": "8b6c5616-6cfe-3a34-86cc-5718b3d74f53",
                        "glosses": [
                            "van een kind dat het te vroeg al bekend is met zaken die het eigenlijk pas later zou moeten weten"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "03e0655c-c17d-4738-8344-fcecf5923e84",
                                "sense_id": "ce244884-bc9a-38e4-bf83-98a10c6209c3",
                                "text": "Tieners en hun ontluikende seksualiteit. Al decennia lang stort de cinema zich met films als Kids, The virgin suicides en het recente Diary of a teenage girl gretig op deze intrigerende, maar delicate thematiek. Ook Eva Husson zoomt met haar Bang gang in op de lichamelijke ontdekkingsreis van vroegrijpe adolescenten."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "13c14411-4178-4afc-8039-546f68afe57c",
                                "sense_id": "ce244884-bc9a-38e4-bf83-98a10c6209c3",
                                "text": "Van die Vinho Verde werden we toen niet echt vrolijk. De wijn werd vroegrijp gebotteld, waardoor een tweede gisting in de fles voor koolzuur zorgde. Dat prikje moest het rijkelijk aanwezige zuur verdoezelen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a768670-1ee5-43bb-9553-5b82cf855579",
                                "sense_id": "ce244884-bc9a-38e4-bf83-98a10c6209c3",
                                "text": "Nou heb je verlegen meisjes, laatbloeiers die liefst zo lang mogelijk bij moeders pappot blijven. En er zijn wat meer vroegrijpe types die al vroeg hun charmes in de strijd gooien en niets liever doen dan uitgaan en dansen. Hetzelfde zie je ook bij fruit. En net als bij jonge meisjes spelen hormonen hierbij een grote rol."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8ef07fa6-0865-4d4a-ac47-5094b548710d",
                        "source_entry_id": "8b6c5616-6cfe-3a34-86cc-5718b3d74f53",
                        "source_sense_id": "ce244884-bc9a-38e4-bf83-98a10c6209c3",
                        "target_lang_word": "precocious",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "precocious",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "57cbe7f9-5bc6-3e73-9394-d5703be3e36a",
                                        "entry_id": "023257af-c7d9-34c4-86cc-6aa14e22b57a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Characterized by exceptionally early development or maturity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "367a8a73-12cb-4300-8419-109e086aff0e",
                                                "sense_id": "57cbe7f9-5bc6-3e73-9394-d5703be3e36a",
                                                "text": "The precocious plant was already blooming flowers by day 4."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1cc9a6c7-323a-44d8-8fb5-e7e33d5dd874",
                                                "sense_id": "57cbe7f9-5bc6-3e73-9394-d5703be3e36a",
                                                "text": "Now those abominations whom you call precocious boys—your little pet monsters, doctor!—and who can wonder that the world is what it is? when it is full of them—as they will have no divine time to look back upon in their own lives, how can they believe in innocence and goodness, or be other than sons of selfishness and the Devil?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f32ead16-04e4-4774-99d4-b844bebd31b9",
                                                "sense_id": "57cbe7f9-5bc6-3e73-9394-d5703be3e36a",
                                                "text": "She's precocious and she knows just / What it takes to make a pro blush"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aec024aa-e858-464d-bfb5-124984d20066",
                                                "sense_id": "57cbe7f9-5bc6-3e73-9394-d5703be3e36a",
                                                "text": "Scotland’s most encouraging early source of an attacking threat was Andrew Robertson as the precocious left-back charged forward to good effect on a couple of occasions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d4c565e-de59-464a-bdf3-6fe5897ac254",
                                                "sense_id": "57cbe7f9-5bc6-3e73-9394-d5703be3e36a",
                                                "text": "Both groups, also, have already evolved precocious (intracapsular) spore germination."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e3e2714-8be2-3185-bf82-6392d7055c1d",
                                        "entry_id": "023257af-c7d9-34c4-86cc-6aa14e22b57a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exhibiting advanced skills and aptitudes at an abnormally early age."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1a343f3-99fe-41f9-8682-2cd83cb4a6be",
                                                "sense_id": "4e3e2714-8be2-3185-bf82-6392d7055c1d",
                                                "text": "The precocious child began reading the newspaper at age four."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d26d9a3-e18d-4704-9ab7-eb1d6cef55bd",
                                                "sense_id": "4e3e2714-8be2-3185-bf82-6392d7055c1d",
                                                "text": "Mary: Even though the sound of it is something quite atrocious / If you say it loud enough you'll always sound precocious."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
